--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Use a column at the far right side of the ProPricer Direct Rate Spreadsheets. 
-- Add the following formula to the 2nd row cell. Use 'Copy Down' command to fill remaining cells in the column with the same formula.
